'''Latios''' (Japanese: '''ラティオス''' ''Latios'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Secluded Springs}} expansion.

