==Trivia==
===Origin===
*'''Fantastical Floating'''{{'}}s Japanese name, '''むげんフロート''' ''Mugen Furōto'' is a reference to Latios's [[Pokémon category]], '''むげんポケモン''' ''Mugen Pokémon'' (the Eon Pokémon).
*{{m|Luster Purge}} is {{p|Latios}}'s [[signature move]] in the [[Pokémon games]].
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Y}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Latios}}.

